 font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 de Novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00ba Prazo:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (31\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00ba Prazo:<\/strong> 12.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (09\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (14\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 6 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 de Novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00ba Prazo:<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (31\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00ba Prazo:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (09\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (14\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida Cidade de Alverca 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partidas \u00e0s 09:15 (caminhada) e 10:00 (corrida 10 km) junto ao Centro de Est\u00e1gio do FC Alverca, concelho de Vila Franca de Xira.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disp\u00f5e da Corrida de 10 km (para participantes a partir dos 18 anos) e da Caminhada de 6 km (aberta a participantes a partir dos 6 anos e fam\u00edlias).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica unissexo, saco\/mochila, dorsal oficial, chip eletr\u00f3nico (apenas para a corrida de 10 km), medalha de finalista e conv\u00edvio final com bifana.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento decorre no Alverca Padel Club a 13 de novembro (20h00 \u00e0s 22h30) e 14 de novembro (09h30 \u00e0s 12h30), ou no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova entre as 08h00 e 09h00 apenas para residentes a mais de 20 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial pode ser consultado no documento oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o: https:\/\/xistarca.pt\/wp-content\/uploads\/Regulamento-9Corrida-Cidade-de-Alverca.pdf.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida Cidade de Alverca 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Centro de Est\u00e1gio do FC Alverca, Alverca do Ribatejo\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Franca de Xira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Portugal Talentus\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida Cidade de Alverca 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partidas \u00e0s 09:15 (caminhada) e 10:00 (corrida 10 km) junto ao Centro de Est\u00e1gio do FC Alverca, concelho de Vila Franca de Xira.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disp\u00f5e da Corrida de 10 km (para participantes a partir dos 18 anos) e da Caminhada de 6 km (aberta a participantes a partir dos 6 anos e fam\u00edlias).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de participante da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica unissexo, saco\/mochila, dorsal oficial, chip eletr\u00f3nico (apenas para a corrida de 10 km), medalha de finalista e conv\u00edvio final com bifana.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento decorre no Alverca Padel Club a 13 de novembro (20h00 \u00e0s 22h30) e 14 de novembro (09h30 \u00e0s 12h30), ou no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova entre as 08h00 e 09h00 apenas para residentes a mais de 20 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento oficial pode ser consultado no documento oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o: https:\/\/xistarca.pt\/wp-content\/uploads\/Regulamento-9Corrida-Cidade-de-Alverca.pdf.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69230,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-54342","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vila-franca-de-xira-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-corrida-cidade-de-alverca.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/54342","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]